    "case_id": "amb1-case01-product-scope",
    "focal_pair": {
      "annotated_sentence_text": "[Turn 2 USER]\ne011\tI think you are making them sound louder and more demanding than they are.\ne012\tThey have been patient through two rough releases and gave us access to their users when we were still tiny.\ne013\tAlso, Lina, our strongest engineer, thinks about seventy percent of the underlying work could become a general reporting layer.\ne014\tShe is excited by it in a way she has not been excited by the reliability backlog.\ne015\tThat matters, even if it is not a market study.\n[Turn 2 ASSISTANT]\ne016\tFair correction.\ne017\tTheir request may be both a relationship obligation and a legitimate product lead.\ne018\tLina's judgment and motivation are evidence, but not yet evidence that the remaining thirty percent—or the support expectations around it—will stay contained.\ne019\tA short technical and workflow discovery could separate the reusable layer from Northline-specific behavior.\ne020\tI would frame that as learning, not as a quiet commitment to build the whole workspace.",
